  variation, opportunity-weighted position priors
- core/data/allocation_coeffs.json: fitted coefficients shipped as data;
  the app never queries pbp
- verification: simulated vs empirical points spread now within ~10% at
  every position (old defaults: QB std 6.8 vs 8.5 empirical, RB 6.9 vs 8.3)

